-and-turn-derivation.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/03-capture-verification.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/04-fork-as-new-thread.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/05-inference-host-routing.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/06-startup-validation-and-assignment-config.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/coverage.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/team-impl-log.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/tech-design.md\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/test-plan.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
